Proof.
ltac2:(KReplay.run1 (kr_t_Na0SegStrlen ()) ["FPX_0"] "h01rh14regsp;1p;2p;3p-1R0p10000p4p710p9P0p1000Sp4p710p9P0p1001?R1p4p710p9P0P1p4p7210p9P0P1p4p73110p9P0p1001]p4p710p9g002UR0p4p7210R1p1003Ap4p710p8P1p1003]p4p710R1p8p1004;p4p710P1p8g004Zj10Tg005?j16Tg005dj12Tg006Bj11TP0j25Tg006ej34Tg007<j23Tg008>#0R0#6#2R1%00#0#0#0#0#2#1'5%11R1f0R0g008c541W0/30W1o"). Qed.
