Proof.
ltac2:(KReplay.run1 (kr_t_Na0SegStrlen ()) ["FPX_0"] "h01Hh12Hnh21rh34regsh45regs'p;1p;2p;3p-1R0p10000p4p710p9P0p1000Sp4p710p9P0p1001?R1p4p710p9P0P1p4p7210p9P0P1p4p73110p9P0p1001]p4p710p9g002UR0p4p7210R1p1003Ap4p710p8P1p1003]p4p710R1p8p1004;p4p710P1p8g004Zj10Tg005?j17Tg005dj12Tg006Bj11TP0j26Tg00:mj25Tg006ej34Tg00=6j13Tg008>#0R0#7#2R1%00#0#0#0#0#2#1'6R0%11R1f2R2f1R3'5g008c9413#3P3P2f0O2W1W0W2X40W3o"). Qed.
